    "authorAssociation": "CONTRIBUTOR",
    "body": "Is there any way we can list dot files using `Pick files`?\r\ne.g. `if tool == 'rg' then return { 'rg', '--files', '--no-follow', '--color=never', '--hidden' } end`",
    "bodyHTML": "<p dir=\"auto\">Is there any way we can list dot files using <code class=\"notranslate\">Pick files</code>?<br>\ne.g. <code class=\"notranslate\">if tool == 'rg' then return { 'rg', '--files', '--no-follow', '--color=never', '--hidden' } end</code></p>",
    "bodyText": "Is there any way we can list dot files using Pick files?\ne.g. if tool == 'rg' then return { 'rg', '--files', '--no-follow', '--color=never', '--hidden' } end",
    "category": {
