            },
            "authorAssociation": "MEMBER",
            "body": "There are at least two choices here:\r\n- [Customize `rg` CLI tool](https://github.com/echasnovski/mini.nvim/blob/a118a964c94543c06d8b1f2f7542535dd2e19d36/doc/mini-pick.txt#L79-L84) to search hidden files by default. This is what I use.\r\n- Create custom picker using [`builtin.cli()`](https://github.com/echasnovski/mini.nvim/blob/a118a964c94543c06d8b1f2f7542535dd2e19d36/doc/mini-pick.txt#L1141) to call the command you want.",
            "bodyHTML": "<p dir=\"auto\">There are at least two choices here:</p>\n<ul dir=\"auto\">\n<li><a href=\"https://github.com/echasnovski/mini.nvim/blob/a118a964c94543c06d8b1f2f7542535dd2e19d36/doc/mini-pick.txt#L79-L84\">Customize <code class=\"notranslate\">rg</code> CLI tool</a> to search hidden files by default. This is what I use.</li>\n<li>Create custom picker using <a href=\"https://github.com/echasnovski/mini.nvim/blob/a118a964c94543c06d8b1f2f7542535dd2e19d36/doc/mini-pick.txt#L1141\"><code class=\"notranslate\">builtin.cli()</code></a> to call the command you want.</li>\n</ul>",
            "bodyText": "There are at least two choices here:\n\nCustomize rg CLI tool to search hidden files by default. This is what I use.\nCreate custom picker using builtin.cli() to call the command you want.",
